            "heading_path": "3. 功能描述",
            "chunk_index": 2,
            "content_hash": "eec0b40f7c43a94a10d8e9752d510d6954cd348baf0d45bf4722bc304dba16a1",
            "text": "# 3. 功能描述\n\n`POST /api/orders/{order_id}/cancel`：\n\n- 将订单状态置 `CANCELLED`，记录 `cancelled_at`；\n- 若订单使用了优惠券，将用户券恢复为 `UNUSED`，清空 `used_order_id` 与 `used_at`，并把券模板的 `used_quantity` 减 1（不小于 0）；\n- 不处理库存（下单本就没有扣减）；\n- 不处理支付单（若已创建 `PENDING` 支付单，记录保留）。\n\n",
            "kb_content_version": "kb-e38fd1b4f50d9e82efdd841f248f20dff86578fc8b9c3c3587eb022ec8b08813",
            "kb_build_version": "kb-build-87b027aa2a8c31cb92ec6d8f728820768e6c4f9a9167c04ee4946cd37910c0c2",
            "retrieval_channels": [
              "keyword",
              "vector",
              "endpoint_behavior"
            ],
            "rrf_score": 0.02964254577157803,
            "rerank_score": null,
